the fomorian~
A fomorian giant reaches for you.
~
  Like all his kind, the fomorian is hideously and uniquely deformed.
One eye hangs in the center of his forehead, and the other rests atop
his pate. From one side of his head dangles a pair of drooping ears.
His broad nose ends in a single cavernous nostril, and an ivory curtain
of crooked teeth jut out over his thick lower lip. He is so large that
the wiry hair on his back brushes the ceiling.
~
